**/.localhistory/
.vshistory/

# Ionide
**/.ionide/

# MFractors
**/.mfractor/

## -------------------------------------------------------
## Blazor WebAssembly
## -------------------------------------------------------
# The _framework/ directory contains compiled .wasm, .dll,
# blazor.boot.json, and compressed .br/.gz files generated
# during build/publish. These MUST NOT be committed.
**/wwwroot/_framework/
_framework/

# Static content from NuGet packages (generated on build)
**/wwwroot/_content/

# Blazor scoped CSS bundle (regenerated on build)
**/*.styles.css

## -------------------------------------------------------
## Azure Functions
## -------------------------------------------------------
local.settings.json
appsettings.Development.json

# Azure build output
csx/
*.build.csdef

# Azure Emulator
ecf/
rcf/

# Azure Stream Analytics
ASALocalRun/

# AWS SAM (if ever used)
.aws-sam

